      "versionId": "SV3-U34-D01-V01",
      "label": "Primary transport",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U34-P01-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U34-P01",
        "documentId": "SV3-U34-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U34-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u34-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 42,
        "charEnd": 128,
        "lineStart": 4,
        "lineEnd": 4,
        "text": "The mobile gateway negotiated HTTP/2 in production and recorded the selected protocol.",
        "textSha256": "892b5d12b07df4f5e1247238c19f4b088c8fa51afb9696e90a3458cc4d9f1a3d"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U34-P02",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U34",
      "documentId": "SV3-U34-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U34-D01-V01",
      "label": "Fallback transport",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U34-P02-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U34-P02",
        "documentId": "SV3-U34-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U34-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u34-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 149,
        "charEnd": 226,
        "lineStart": 7,
        "lineEnd": 7,
        "text": "A retired fallback endpoint remained on HTTP/1.1 during the migration window.",
        "textSha256": "07dcf970d234ab95b68351552c89f768edfdd9ae286dc57775eb025b4d958cb3"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U34-P03",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U34",
      "documentId": "SV3-U34-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U34-D01-V01",
      "label": "Offline queue",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U34-P03-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U34-P03",
        "documentId": "SV3-U34-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U34-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u34-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 242,
        "charEnd": 330,
        "lineStart": 10,
        "lineEnd": 10,
        "text": "The offline queue used NimbusCache to retain submitted work until connectivity returned.",
        "textSha256": "7dbc068b3fdff60e4aad7444bcf246495278b8e6394ca7ed4c6c0d2e3d50d3df"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U34-P04",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U34",
      "documentId": "SV3-U34-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U34-D01-V01",
      "label": "Unshipped prototype",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U34-P04-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U34-P04",
        "documentId": "SV3-U34-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U34-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u34-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 352,
        "charEnd": 439,
        "lineStart": 13,
        "lineEnd": 13,
        "text": "A separate prototype mentioned ZephyrDBX but was never connected to the mobile gateway.",
        "textSha256": "6ee81407ff513e4b3e22453ac8ce495b93d2ebe0eff887a797e543e5125b61d7"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U35-P01",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U35",
      "documentId": "SV3-U35-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U35-D01-V01",
      "label": "정책 조사 기간",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U35-P01-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U35-P01",
        "documentId": "SV3-U35-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U35-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u35-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 24,
        "charEnd": 76,
        "lineStart": 4,
        "lineEnd": 4,
        "text": "정책 조사 기간은 2024-03-01부터 2025-02-28까지였고 월별 검토 기록을 남겼다.",
        "textSha256": "a5ece692ab1460d13f2fdabb062ac0031d8885cfe9b820ccc18cc91a8e684179"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U35-P02",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U35",
      "documentId": "SV3-U35-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U35-D01-V01",
      "label": "전국 적용 시작",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U35-P02-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U35-P02",
        "documentId": "SV3-U35-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U35-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u35-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 87,
        "charEnd": 137,
        "lineStart": 7,
        "lineEnd": 7,
        "text": "전국 rollout은 2025-07-01에 시작됐고 지역별 담당자가 적용 상태를 확인했다.",
        "textSha256": "49734e79e41f1c469a6f685a7bd5bd8e9e5b5b166004d9a7f5b4c723e7309ac1"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U35-P03",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U35",
      "documentId": "SV3-U35-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U35-D01-V01",
      "label": "계획 관리 도구",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U35-P03-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U35-P03",
        "documentId": "SV3-U35-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U35-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u35-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 148,
        "charEnd": 183,
        "lineStart": 10,
        "lineEnd": 10,
        "text": "프로그램 일정과 의사결정 기록은 AtlasPlan으로 관리했다.",
        "textSha256": "93576959edee7a0a97fc3d49ed82b7798a0111e6477317f5b29d979cf5475ad1"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U35-P04",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U35",
      "documentId": "SV3-U35-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U35-D01-V01",
      "label": "미채택 초안",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U35-P04-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U35-P04",
        "documentId": "SV3-U35-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U35-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u35-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 192,
        "charEnd": 230,
        "lineStart": 13,
        "lineEnd": 13,
        "text": "별도 검토 문서에는 NorthStarX라는 초안 명칭만 남아 있었다.",
        "textSha256": "11c20373cb263f9205665d423bcd0a7a5e71bbb80e493c7ebad1226b9231682a"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U36-P01",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U36",
      "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
      "label": "Current batch runtime",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U36-P01-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U36-P01",
        "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u36-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 46,
        "charEnd": 134,
        "lineStart": 4,
        "lineEnd": 4,
        "text": "The production batch service runs on Java 17 and records its runtime version at startup.",
        "textSha256": "568623bce5b829c8f6063248501a73440f135f188e1b312ef0df29a52fc081e3"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U36-P02",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U36",
      "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
      "label": "Retired utility",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U36-P02-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U36-P02",
        "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u36-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 152,
        "charEnd": 237,
        "lineStart": 7,
        "lineEnd": 7,
        "text": "A retired import utility remained on Java 11 and was excluded from active processing.",
        "textSha256": "e818c0cd9ccc4139e2d42af2a3942f4bfab989a711f446a80ddafdb0c7023f74"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U36-P03",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U36",
      "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
      "label": "재처리 오류 개선",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U36-P03-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U36-P03",
        "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u36-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 249,
        "charEnd": 285,
        "lineStart": 10,
        "lineEnd": 10,
        "text": "검증 단계를 분리한 뒤 재처리 오류율을 정확히 50% 감소시켰다.",
        "textSha256": "5c1155eb7fbf44be082fab3a3965e4e543671729e41c3ac35de47e5a0cb66007"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U36-P04",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U36",
      "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
      "label": "데이터 검증량",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U36-P04-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U36-P04",
        "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u36-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 295,
        "charEnd": 366,
        "lineStart": 13,
        "lineEnd": 13,
        "text": "The import job validated 데이터 2,329건 before publishing the daily report.",
        "textSha256": "ca056563843b5b6a9a5bc4e06c339e2a0466f9e3528cf8aaa5dcee8435b0a96b"
      }
    },
    {
      "parentId": "SV3-U36-P05",
      "userBundleId": "SV3-U36",
      "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
      "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
      "label": "사용자 preview",
      "sourceSpan": {
        "spanId": "SV3-U36-P05-PS01",
        "parentId": "SV3-U36-P05",
        "documentId": "SV3-U36-D01",
        "versionId": "SV3-U36-D01-V01",
        "sourcePath": "documents/sv3-u36-typed-stress-v01.txt",
        "sourceType": "TXT_TEXT",
        "page": null,
        "charStart": 380,
        "charEnd": 455,
        "lineStart": 16,
        "lineEnd": 16,
        "text": "A small preview involved 사용자 300명 and did not proceed to a general release.",
        "textSha256": "b4b198def9a1b91bb43465e3b9ebbaf5914bfa899995fc79d0cd61ac268c8f01"
      }
    }
